<title>FRANCE: Bongrain 1996 net 300.5 mln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Bongrain 1996 net 300.5 mln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			   300.5  vs	   356.8</p>
<p>    Net					    339.1  vs	   397.0</p>
<p>    Net dividend (francs)			 61  vs		61</p>
<p>    Pre-tax, pre-exceptional		 525.5  vs	   610.0</p>
<p>    Investments				  393	 no comparison</p>
<p>    Turnover				  10,406.3  vs	 9,931.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Bongrain SA gave its results in a statement. It said in a difficult European economic climate and an unfavourable milk market, the company is giving priority to finding and developing new markets in central Europe and Asia and to its policy of sustained industrial and commercial investment in Europe, North and South America. Market share for the group's major brands has consolidated. It had cashflow of 626 million francs, the company gave no comparison. The short-terms effects of an evolving milk market will not change the strategy and long term outlook for the group.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
